abstract: >-
  Reproducible benchmark for neural audio codecs on phone-degraded speech:
  SNAC vs EnCodec round-trips on FLEURS + noisekit (clean, telecom, noisy).
  Reports STOI, narrowband PESQ at 8 kHz, SNR, and GPU encode/decode latency.
  Colab notebook and published baseline results included.
